OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwill speak with his Russian counterpart
OL,8,FVladimir Putin soon about the death of
OL,9,Fa lab worker at a plague research
OL,10,Fcentre in Siberia.
OL,12,F"So far we are in very deep
OL,13,Fdiscussions," Trump said, adding that
OL,14,Fhe would be able to report on his talks
OL,15,Fwith Putin "probably" on Thursday.
OL,16,FKremlin spokesman Dmitry Peskov said no
OL,17,Fphone call had been scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
